WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Walking across the Praça do Comércio, under the yellow arcades, towards the statue of Joseph I.

2
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:28.500
From the castle hill: the roofs of the old town and the river Tagus.

3
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:55.000
Inside the castle: performers in historical costume read a proclamation to a small crowd.
